WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.179 --> 00:00:02.870
Is SCP-096 blind?

00:00:02.870 --> 00:00:07.819
It seems like a weird question, but debate
rages on among SCP Foundation experts as to

00:00:07.819 --> 00:00:13.700
whether 096 is capable of seeing or even thinking,
or whether its rages and ability to flawlessly

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:17.370
track its victim comes as a result of raw
psychic compulsion.

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:18.580
Why do we want to know?

00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:23.510
Well, because of the big question: Could you
get 096 to freak out and attack itself if

00:00:23.510 --> 00:00:25.500
you showed it its own reflection?

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:29.840
The only way of truly knowing is walking into
its cell and trying it, but personally, I

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:35.230
value my own life a little too highly to potentially
get eaten in the process of finding out.

